WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:02.290
<b>YOU DIDN'T COME TO OUR AFTERNOON CLASSES.
LEFT EARLY? FEELING SICK? ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?</b>

00:02.380 --> 00:03.380
<b>There.</b>

00:03.460 --> 00:04.420
<b>AKI: EVERYTHING'S FINE.</b>

00:04.500 --> 00:07.750
<b><i>Nothing's really fine at all, actually.</i></b>

00:07.830 --> 00:10.330
<b><i>There's way too much I need to do.</i></b>

00:10.420 --> 00:13.500
<b><i>What would be most efficient way to start?</i></b>

00:13.580 --> 00:16.040
<b><i>Ugh, I can't even think.</i></b>

00:16.630 --> 00:19.920
<b>Damn it. What a waste of time.</b>

00:21.040 --> 00:23.830
<b><i>Iroha let herself in again?</i></b>

00:25.170 --> 00:26.250
<b>Huh?</b>

00:28.670 --> 00:31.920
<b>What are you doing, Iroha?</b>

00:33.630 --> 00:34.670
<b>Senpai.</b>

00:37.750 --> 00:40.250
<b>Should you be up and about?</b>

00:40.670 --> 00:42.750
<b>Yeah, I'll manage.</b>

00:42.830 --> 00:44.460
<b>That's good to hear.</b>

00:44.540 --> 00:47.830
<b>I was worried when I heard
you'd left school early.</b>

00:47.920 --> 00:49.710
<b>Don't push yourself too hard, though.</b>

00:50.960 --> 00:52.830
<b><i>What's up with her?</i></b>

00:52.920 --> 00:55.330
<b><i>Why's she in honor-student</i>
<i>mode at my place?</i></b>

00:55.670 --> 00:57.250
<b><i>What's she plotting?</i></b>

00:57.540 --> 00:58.500
<b>Oh!</b>

00:58.580 --> 01:01.750
<b>I won't do anything funny. Don't worry.</b>

01:01.830 --> 01:04.580
<b>The food will be ready soon,
so go back to bed and wait, okay?</b>

01:04.670 --> 01:06.630
<b>O-Okay.</b>

01:32.710 --> 01:38.380
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

02:38.670 --> 02:42.670
<b>#08 "EVERYONE I KNOW IS BEING WEIRD WITH ME"</b>

02:42.750 --> 02:45.380
<b>I made something easily digestible for you.</b>

02:45.460 --> 02:46.790
<b>Do you think you can eat?</b>

02:47.250 --> 02:48.880
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:52.210
<b>I'll feed it to you.</b>

02:52.290 --> 02:55.500
<b>Seriously, there's no need for that. I'm fine.</b>

02:55.580 --> 02:58.420
<b>No, please allow me to do at least this.</b>

02:58.500 --> 03:02.580
<b>It's a junior's job to take care
of her ailing senpai.</b>

03:02.670 --> 03:04.210
<b>You're overreacting.</b>

03:04.500 --> 03:06.750
<b>I'm not overreacting at all!</b>

03:06.830 --> 03:10.710
<b>You'd never leave school early
under normal circumstances, right?</b>

03:10.790 --> 03:15.040
<b>You always say your health is your capital,
so you take good care of it.</b>

03:15.460 --> 03:17.670
<b>Well, that's true.</b>

03:17.960 --> 03:22.130
<b>I think you were more tired
than even you realized.</b>

03:22.210 --> 03:24.460
<b>Yeah, maybe so.</b>

03:24.540 --> 03:29.750
<b>So please allow me to help you get better.</b>

03:29.830 --> 03:32.250
<b>You always do so much for me, after all.</b>

03:32.330 --> 03:35.210
<b>You can at least rely on me
in times like these.</b>

03:35.290 --> 03:36.380
<b>O-Okay.</b>

03:38.790 --> 03:40.250
<b>H-Hey!</b>

03:40.330 --> 03:42.790
<b>I can't have you burning your mouth, can I?</b>

03:43.130 --> 03:46.080
<b>Okay, Senpai. Open wide.</b>

03:46.580 --> 03:49.830
<b><i>What is this disgustingly embarrassing event?!</i></b>

03:50.460 --> 03:52.580
<b>There's no need to feel self-conscious.</b>

03:52.670 --> 03:55.960
<b>Being cared for when you're sick
is nothing to be ashamed of.</b>

03:56.290 --> 03:58.460
<b><i>It's like she's a whole different person.</i></b>

03:59.670 --> 04:00.830
<b>That's good.</b>

04:01.540 --> 04:03.250
<b>I'm glad to hear it.</b>

04:03.880 --> 04:05.960
<b>Th-Thanks for the food.</b>

04:06.040 --> 04:07.540
<b>The pleasure is all mine.</b>

04:07.880 --> 04:10.250
<b>Oh, here, Senpai.</b>

04:12.540 --> 04:14.460
<b>Th-Thanks. Sorry.</b>

04:14.540 --> 04:15.710
<b>It's all right.</b>

04:16.130 --> 04:18.880
<b>I'm doing this because I want to.</b>

04:18.960 --> 04:21.500
<b>Now, is there anything else
you'd like me to do for you?</b>

04:21.580 --> 04:25.170
<b>No, I'm good. Thanks.</b>

04:25.420 --> 04:26.960
<b>Okay, then.</b>

04:27.040 --> 04:31.170
<b>Well, if I stay too long,
I'll only be in your way.</b>

04:31.500 --> 04:33.540
<b>I'll go home after I clean all this up.</b>

04:34.500 --> 04:36.540
<b>Get plenty of rest, okay?</b>

04:46.420 --> 04:47.880
<b>Gotcha!</b>

04:47.960 --> 04:50.290
<b>Did you really think I'd go home that easily?</b>

04:55.920 --> 04:57.580
<b><i>What is she up to?!</i></b>

04:57.670 --> 04:58.630
<b>WHAT ARE YOU UP TO? WHY ARE YOU PUTTING
ON THIS ACT EVEN AT MY PLACE?</b>

04:58.710 --> 04:59.670
<b>WELL, THAT'S WHAT YOU LIKE, ISN'T IT?
YOU PREFER THE NICE AND NEAT TYPE, RIGHT?</b>

04:59.750 --> 05:01.580
<b>WHAT'D YOU THINK?! YOU LIKED THAT A LOT MORE
THAN HOW I USUALLY AM, DIDN'T YOU?!</b>

05:01.670 --> 05:06.170
<b><i>I'm never gonna mess with you</i>
<i>like that again! Jerk! Dummy!</i></b>

05:06.750 --> 05:09.670
<b><i>An irritating text, and yet</i>
<i>it inspires relief and trust.</i></b>

05:10.960 --> 05:14.000
<b><i>Wait, is she trying to be</i>
<i>the opposite of Mashiro?</i></b>

05:14.580 --> 05:16.500
<b><i>Mashiro is all sweet in her texts,</i></b>

05:17.290 --> 05:19.250
<b><i>but in reality, she's harsh with me.</i></b>

05:19.710 --> 05:22.290
<b><i>Meanwhile, Iroha's being sweet in reality</i></b>

05:22.380 --> 05:24.380
<b><i>but harsh in her texts.</i></b>

05:24.790 --> 05:27.210
<b><i>If there's one thing they have in common,</i></b>

05:27.290 --> 05:30.790
<b><i>it's that I have no idea</i>
<i>why they have to be like this.</i></b>

05:30.880 --> 05:34.380
<b><i>What am I supposed to do here?</i></b>

05:35.380 --> 05:37.130
<b>ANSWER</b>

05:37.960 --> 05:39.880
<b><i>Hey, Ozu. What's up?</i></b>

05:39.960 --> 05:43.250
<b>I thought you might be having a rough time.</b>

05:43.330 --> 05:44.330
<b>How are things?</b>

05:44.420 --> 05:46.170
<b><i>You're really perceptive.</i></b>

05:46.250 --> 05:51.670
<b>I actually invented a system that monitors
your heart rate around the clock.</b>

05:52.130 --> 05:55.920
<b>For real? That actually
weirds me out a little.</b>

05:56.960 --> 05:58.960
<b><i>C'mon, you know I'm joking.</i></b>

05:59.040 --> 06:03.250
<b>It doesn't sound that much like a joke
coming from a guy who could actually do it.</b>

06:03.670 --> 06:07.670
<b>Anyway, the truth is,
Iroha got back a few minutes ago,</b>

06:08.040 --> 06:10.750
<b>but she just shut herself in her room
without saying a word.</b>

06:10.830 --> 06:13.130
<b>She must be in a pretty bad mood.</b>

06:13.790 --> 06:15.040
<b>Did something happen?</b>

06:15.420 --> 06:19.130
<b>Oh, so that's why. Well, we kind of...</b>

06:19.750 --> 06:20.880
<b><i>Hang on.</i></b>

06:20.960 --> 06:24.040
<b><i>I probably shouldn't tell Ozu</i>
<i>about that confession.</i></b>

06:24.130 --> 06:27.460
<b><i>I need to consider Mashiro's feelings, too.</i></b>

06:28.750 --> 06:31.880
<b><i>That was a long pause. I guess there's</i>
<i>something you can't tell me, huh?</i></b>

06:31.960 --> 06:35.380
<b>A perceptive friend like you
is the best kind to have.</b>

06:35.710 --> 06:38.670
<b>I like to think I know
your personality pretty well.</b>

06:39.080 --> 06:41.420
<b>Okay, then. I won't ask.</b>

06:41.500 --> 06:45.250
<b>But that'll mean I can't help.
Can you handle things by yourself?</b>

06:45.500 --> 06:50.420
<b>Yeah. This is definitely something
I need to resolve on my own.</b>

06:51.080 --> 06:54.580
<b><i>I'm more concerned about Makigai</i>
<i>Namako-sensei's written scenario.</i></b>

06:54.670 --> 06:57.330
<b>Yeah... What should we do about that?</b>

06:57.630 --> 07:01.580
<b>I'm thinking of sending a message
to our group chat rejecting it.</b>

07:01.670 --> 07:03.380
<b>It's gonna hurt, though.</b>

07:03.880 --> 07:10.290
<b><i>But I expect Sensei to respond with,</i>
<i>"That's just your personal opinion," so...</i></b>

07:10.380 --> 07:11.880
<b>Okay, got it.</b>

07:11.960 --> 07:16.880
<b>If Sensei pushes back, I should just
say I had the same opinion, yeah?</b>

07:16.960 --> 07:18.130
<b>I appreciate it.</b>

07:18.210 --> 07:20.790
<b><i>Got it. And take care of yourself, okay?</i></b>

07:20.880 --> 07:21.960
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:22.920 --> 07:26.130
<b><i>I haven't solved any of the problems yet,</i></b>

07:26.210 --> 07:28.500
<b><i>but I'm about to knock them all out at once.</i></b>

07:28.920 --> 07:32.750
<b><i>Thanks to Iroha's rice gruel,</i>
<i>I feel like that fever never even happened.</i></b>

07:33.330 --> 07:35.460
<b><i>I should burn through the tasks</i>
<i>I've got piled up.</i></b>

07:40.710 --> 07:42.500
<b><i>Since I slept a stupidly long time yesterday,</i></b>

07:42.580 --> 07:45.210
<b><i>my brain's operating</i>
<i>at maximum efficiency.</i></b>

07:45.290 --> 07:47.790
<b><i>I got everything done</i>
<i>that I wanted to this morning.</i></b>

07:47.880 --> 07:50.880
<b><i>We'll be able to finish</i>
<i>Iroha's voice recording after school.</i></b>

07:50.960 --> 07:52.080
<b>HMM, I JUST DON'T FEEL MOTIVATED. IF YOU GET
ON YOUR KNEES, I MIGHT THINK ABOUT IT...</b>

07:53.080 --> 07:54.630
<b><i>Still a pain in the ass.</i></b>

07:54.710 --> 07:55.670
<b>SORRY FOR THE SHORT NOTICE, BUT WOULD
WE BE ABLE TO RECORD AFTER SCHOOL TODAY?</b>

07:55.750 --> 07:56.880
<b>FOR 20 CANDIES.
YOU'RE GONNA EAT 20 OF THOSE? YOU WANT DIABETES?</b>

07:56.960 --> 07:57.960
<b>LAND MINE, BRO.
WAIT, THAT'S A LAND MINE?!</b>

07:58.040 --> 07:59.960
<b><i>I was just showing concern for her health.</i></b>

08:00.040 --> 08:02.580
<b><i>I don't get what constitutes</i>
<i>a land mine for Otoi-san.</i></b>

08:04.250 --> 08:05.380
<b>YOU LEFT ME ON READ?? I'M STILL WILLING
TO FORGIVE YOU IF YOU APOLOGIZE NOW.</b>

08:05.460 --> 08:06.710
<b>GET ON YOUR KNEES
AND BEG TO HEAR IROHA-SAN'S VOICE!!</b>

08:09.290 --> 08:11.040
<b>OKAY, OKAY! I GET IT!</b>

08:11.130 --> 08:12.710
<b>YOU WANT ME TO RECORD, I'LL RECORD!</b>

08:13.210 --> 08:14.880
<b>Cool, thanks.</b>

08:15.540 --> 08:17.710
<b>Looking forward to some great acting.</b>

08:21.670 --> 08:22.710
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

08:23.460 --> 08:26.250
<b><i>Is she writing that hobby novel of hers?</i></b>

08:27.420 --> 08:31.750
<b><i>I'm prioritizing 05th Floor Alliance now</i>
<i>to make up for the time I lost being sick,</i></b>

08:31.830 --> 08:35.540
<b><i>but it'd be better to answer her</i>
<i>confession face-to-face, wouldn't it?</i></b>

08:36.040 --> 08:38.670
<b><i>If this inability to hold</i>
<i>a conversation lasts much longer,</i></b>

08:38.750 --> 08:42.130
<b><i>I might have to consider responding via text.</i></b>

08:43.960 --> 08:45.040
<b>Ohboshi-kun.</b>

08:46.580 --> 08:48.460
<b>Kageishi-sensei.</b>

08:48.880 --> 08:50.330
<b>Can I help you?</b>

08:50.420 --> 08:53.880
<b>I don't think I've done anything that
I'd need to see a teacher for today.</b>

08:54.290 --> 08:55.460
<b>Is your fever better?</b>

08:55.540 --> 08:58.290
<b>Uh... yes, it is, I suppose.</b>

08:58.380 --> 09:00.750
<b>I see. That's good to hear.</b>

09:00.830 --> 09:01.880
<b>Well, let's go.</b>

09:01.960 --> 09:03.290
<b>Go? Go where?</b>

09:03.750 --> 09:06.000
<b>Don't ask questions. Just follow me.</b>

09:06.580 --> 09:07.630
<b>Remember our promise?</b>

09:07.710 --> 09:09.580
<b>Promise?</b>

09:09.920 --> 09:12.920
<b>Sorry, please save it for next time, then.</b>

09:13.460 --> 09:15.830
<b>Oh, that. All right.</b>

09:16.250 --> 09:18.920
<b>But I'm not gonna be happy
if it's something stupid.</b>

09:19.000 --> 09:21.080
<b>It's important. After all...</b>

09:21.960 --> 09:25.380
<b>you could say my very life
hangs in the balance.</b>

09:27.210 --> 09:30.210
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

09:30.750 --> 09:32.920
<b>Akiteru-sama!</b>

09:33.000 --> 09:35.960
<b>Please save my drama club!</b>

09:36.040 --> 09:37.130
<b>Wha?</b>

09:37.540 --> 09:41.500
<b>Remember when I mentioned
that I'm the drama club advisor?</b>

09:41.580 --> 09:44.830
<b>Yeah, during homeroom.
That was the first I'd ever heard of it.</b>

09:45.670 --> 09:50.170
<b>You see, if we don't pass the National High
School Drama Fair's regional preliminaries</b>

09:50.250 --> 09:53.710
<b>and advance to the prefectural level,
our club will be disbanded!</b>

09:53.790 --> 09:56.960
<b>The principal gave me an ultimatum!</b>

09:57.080 --> 10:00.670
<b>What happened to being in it to win?</b>

10:01.380 --> 10:03.380
<b>Anyway, does it really matter if you disband?</b>

10:03.460 --> 10:06.290
<b>No club means even less work for you, right?</b>

10:06.380 --> 10:08.540
<b>It doesn't work like that.</b>

10:08.630 --> 10:12.040
<b>See, Midori-chan is the president
of the drama club right now.</b>

10:12.130 --> 10:13.080
<b>"Midori-chan"?</b>

10:13.170 --> 10:15.420
<b>Oh, didn't I tell you before?</b>

10:15.500 --> 10:18.420
<b>She's my younger sister. Kageishi Midori.</b>

10:18.500 --> 10:19.750
<b>Hm...</b>

10:20.210 --> 10:22.250
<b>Kageishi Midori...</b>

10:22.580 --> 10:26.960
<b>She's a super-cutie, but I won't give
her up to anyone. Not even to you.</b>

10:27.080 --> 10:28.250
<b>I didn't ask.</b>

10:28.630 --> 10:32.170
<b>Midori-chan is such a serious, diligent girl!</b>

10:32.420 --> 10:36.790
<b>She'll do anything her awesome
big sister asks of her!</b>

10:36.880 --> 10:41.290
<b>She leads practices, does odd jobs, and
handles everything else an advisor should do!</b>

10:41.380 --> 10:43.250
<b>It makes my life so easy!</b>

10:43.330 --> 10:45.290
<b>You're just lending your name, then.</b>

10:45.670 --> 10:49.750
<b>What's wrong with that? Thanks to that,
I have time to illustrate for <i>Black Goat</i>.</b>

10:49.830 --> 10:51.500
<b>Yeah, I guess so.</b>

10:51.580 --> 10:53.920
<b>But if the drama club is disbanded...</b>

10:54.290 --> 10:58.750
<b>I'll be reassigned to the girls' tennis team
while their coach is on maternity leave!</b>

10:58.830 --> 11:01.630
<b>I don't wanna coach the tennis team!</b>

11:01.710 --> 11:03.580
<b>They're actually good at what they do!</b>

11:03.670 --> 11:04.790
<b>They practice for ages,</b>

11:04.880 --> 11:08.250
<b>every morning, noon, and night,
and every single day, including weekends!</b>

11:08.330 --> 11:11.830
<b>And without Midori-chan, I'll have
no one to hide behind and slack off!</b>

11:11.920 --> 11:16.250
<b>If I become their coach,
I'll never have time to draw again!</b>

11:16.500 --> 11:17.460
<b>Huh?</b>

11:17.540 --> 11:21.420
<b>How did you get the idea to coach
our super-hardcore girls' tennis team?</b>

11:21.500 --> 11:22.460
<b>SUMIRE IS SILENT</b>

11:22.540 --> 11:24.250
<b>Wait, don't tell me you...</b>

11:24.580 --> 11:26.540
<b>- I couldn't help myself!
- Hey, quit it! Don't get your snot on me!</b>

11:26.630 --> 11:28.500
<b>I just got carried away!</b>

11:29.040 --> 11:32.500
<b>I hear you also excel at sports,
Kageishi-sensei.</b>

11:33.250 --> 11:35.460
<b>Who do you think you're talking to?</b>

11:35.880 --> 11:40.250
<b>Can you not see this tight, toned body
that puts even athletes to shame?</b>

11:42.330 --> 11:44.080
<b>I kinda got carried away.</b>

11:44.170 --> 11:46.460
<b>You act like that with the principal, too?!</b>

11:46.540 --> 11:48.500
<b>You really are hopeless!</b>

11:48.830 --> 11:50.170
<b>But, but, but!</b>

11:50.250 --> 11:52.500
<b>If people think I'm just a nerd
who can't handle sports,</b>

11:52.580 --> 11:56.920
<b>the other teachers will make fun of me,
and I'll be bullied in the faculty room!</b>

11:57.830 --> 12:01.380
<b>I swear... This is what happens
when you lie about who you are.</b>

12:01.460 --> 12:04.830
<b><i>But she's right.</i>
<i>That wouldn't be great for us.</i></b>

12:05.420 --> 12:06.750
<b>Oh, damn it!</b>

12:07.420 --> 12:11.750
<b>Isn't this something the drama club
should accomplish on their own merits?</b>

12:12.130 --> 12:13.630
<b>If their own merits were enough,</b>

12:13.710 --> 12:17.040
<b>I wouldn't have had to made you
indebted to me by meeting my deadline!</b>

12:17.130 --> 12:19.790
<b>That doesn't make me indebted.
It's called doing your job.</b>

12:20.210 --> 12:22.540
<b>If you don't help,
I'll be so busy with the tennis team</b>

12:22.630 --> 12:24.960
<b>that I won't be able to meet <i>any</i> deadlines.</b>

12:25.080 --> 12:27.290
<b>You never met them before, either!</b>

12:27.920 --> 12:33.290
<b>Anyway, come observe one of our
lunch-hour practice sessions! Just one!</b>

12:34.540 --> 12:36.250
<b>- Okay, fine.
- What?!</b>

12:36.630 --> 12:41.630
<b>- Yay! You're a god! The almighty Akiteru-sama!
- So, where do you hold these sessions?</b>

12:41.960 --> 12:46.080
<b>At the far end of the fourth floor
of the special classroom building,</b>

12:46.170 --> 12:49.790
<b>there's a classroom rumored to be
cursed, so nobody goes near it,</b>

12:49.880 --> 12:52.580
<b>That makes it perfect
for our club's activities.</b>

12:54.080 --> 12:57.880
<b>One! Two! Now! One! Two! Three! Four!</b>

12:57.960 --> 12:59.460
<b>Okay, we'll stop there.</b>

13:01.170 --> 13:02.880
<b>We'll do vocalization practice next!</b>

13:04.330 --> 13:07.130
<b>What do you think?
That's my sister, Midori-chan!</b>

13:08.290 --> 13:11.830
<b>Oh, now I remember.
She's at the top of our year.</b>

13:12.380 --> 13:16.500
<b>She's gotten perfect scores in
every subject since she started here,</b>

13:16.580 --> 13:19.080
<b>and she's never fallen from
the number one spot.</b>

13:19.170 --> 13:21.380
<b>She's a prodigy among prodigies.</b>

13:21.880 --> 13:26.330
<b>So she keeps her grades up
while leading the drama club, too?</b>

13:26.420 --> 13:31.880
<b>Yes! To be perfect in both club work
and academics is her creed.</b>

13:31.960 --> 13:35.750
<b>Wow. Maybe you should get a DNA test?</b>

13:35.830 --> 13:38.580
<b>Could you not cast doubt
on our blood relationship, please?</b>

13:39.500 --> 13:44.920
<b><i>Actually, with a leader as good as her,</i>
<i>do they even need to worry?</i></b>

13:45.000 --> 13:47.040
<b>Okay, that takes care of the basics!</b>

13:47.670 --> 13:50.880
<b>- Now, it's time for dress rehearsal!
- Right!</b>

13:57.000 --> 14:00.460
<b><i>Oh, they have their sound and sets</i>
<i>and everything prepared, huh?</i></b>

14:00.750 --> 14:03.040
<b>- Everyone ready?
- Yes!</b>

14:03.130 --> 14:06.080
<b>Okay, we'll start with Act 1, Scene 2!</b>

14:15.630 --> 14:20.670
<b>You are only watching, not observing.</b>

14:20.750 --> 14:22.040
<b>Observing.</b>

14:22.130 --> 14:23.670
<b>Observing!</b>

14:23.750 --> 14:27.500
<b>Watching and observing are
two very different things.</b>

14:28.210 --> 14:30.250
<b>Do you understand?</b>

14:31.000 --> 14:32.170
<b><i>Is she a robot?</i></b>

14:32.250 --> 14:34.420
<b>Entropy!</b>

14:34.500 --> 14:36.500
<b>- Valence!
- Electrons!</b>

14:36.580 --> 14:37.830
<b>Entropy!</b>

14:38.710 --> 14:39.670
<b>Potassium!</b>

14:39.750 --> 14:42.420
<b>E equals MC squared!</b>

14:44.040 --> 14:45.750
<b><i>Why is she banging a gong?</i></b>

14:46.210 --> 14:49.080
<b>The theory of relativity!</b>

14:49.170 --> 14:54.130
<b>- Einstein! Einstein! Einstein!
- Sine! Cosine! Tangent!</b>

14:54.210 --> 14:55.580
<b><i>I can't even hear them properly.</i></b>

14:55.670 --> 14:58.880
<b>Move, point P! Move, point P! Move, point P!</b>

14:59.710 --> 15:01.290
<b>Treat a particle...</b>

15:01.380 --> 15:03.670
<b>not as a zero-dimensional point...</b>

15:03.960 --> 15:07.290
<b>but as a one-dimensional...</b>

15:07.380 --> 15:11.290
<b>string!</b>

15:15.040 --> 15:16.080
<b>Good!</b>

15:18.830 --> 15:19.790
<b>Yo.</b>

15:19.880 --> 15:24.420
<b>What was that? I thought it was a musical,
but then it took a turn for the surreal.</b>

15:24.500 --> 15:27.290
<b>And why display the universe
at the end like it's just natural?</b>

15:27.380 --> 15:29.330
<b>That script is broken as hell!</b>

15:29.630 --> 15:31.580
<b>I gather you understand now.</b>

15:32.250 --> 15:33.710
<b>This is <i>really</i> bad.</b>

15:33.790 --> 15:34.830
<b>Right?</b>

15:35.580 --> 15:38.250
<b>Hm, I'd give today's run...</b>

15:38.750 --> 15:40.330
<b>about eighty points!</b>

15:40.920 --> 15:42.460
<b>Have you lost your mind?!</b>

15:42.540 --> 15:43.580
<b>Huh?!</b>

15:46.130 --> 15:47.830
<b>And who are you?</b>

15:47.920 --> 15:50.210
<b>Don't you think it's a bit rude
to barge in unannounced?</b>

15:50.710 --> 15:55.330
<b>You can't blame me for having a few things to
say after you gave that drivel eighty points.</b>

15:55.420 --> 15:58.500
<b>I've seen better performances
out of elementary school students.</b>

15:58.580 --> 16:01.420
<b>Wh-What?! It's not <i>that</i> bad!</b>

16:02.210 --> 16:05.380
<b>I mean, sure, our growth
has kind of plateaued lately,</b>

16:05.460 --> 16:07.330
<b>and we're not really getting anywhere.</b>

16:07.420 --> 16:09.080
<b>Uh, I'd say you have nowhere to go but up!</b>

16:09.170 --> 16:12.580
<b><i>Ugh, just who is this guy?</i></b>

16:13.330 --> 16:14.580
<b><i>Wait, what?!</i></b>

16:14.670 --> 16:15.830
<b>Oh, Sumire-onee—</b>

16:16.710 --> 16:18.290
<b>I mean, Kageishi-sensei!</b>

16:19.290 --> 16:20.710
<b>I didn't know you were here.</b>

16:20.790 --> 16:25.790
<b>Yes. I came by to make sure
that you're all practicing hard.</b>

16:26.880 --> 16:31.670
<b>I'm so happy you've been coming to our club
meetings more often, Onee—I mean, Sensei!</b>

16:31.750 --> 16:33.210
<b>- Right?
- Yes!</b>

16:33.290 --> 16:35.960
<b>I did say I valued autonomy,</b>

16:36.080 --> 16:40.290
<b>but with the tournament
approaching, I'm fired up, too.</b>

16:40.750 --> 16:45.080
<b>Leading you all to victory would show
that I've done my job as your advisor.</b>

16:45.170 --> 16:46.880
<b>Kageishi-sensei!</b>

16:46.960 --> 16:48.880
<b>- You're the best!
- So cool!</b>

16:48.960 --> 16:50.040
<b>You're amazing!</b>

16:51.040 --> 16:54.630
<b>By the way, Kageishi-sensei,
who is this boorish fellow?</b>

16:54.710 --> 16:57.960
<b>Oh, right. This is Ohboshi Akiteru-kun.
He's a second-year.</b>

16:58.080 --> 17:00.750
<b>I wanted him to observe the drama club.</b>

17:01.000 --> 17:02.330
<b>Observe?</b>

17:02.420 --> 17:05.630
<b>Is he the backup member you mentioned
bringing in for the competition?</b>

17:05.960 --> 17:10.290
<b>As I said before, this drama club
is best with the six of us!</b>

17:10.380 --> 17:12.000
<b>We don't need a new member!</b>

17:12.170 --> 17:13.170
<b>Not quite.</b>

17:13.250 --> 17:16.880
<b>He is the super producer
who will lead this club to victory!</b>

17:16.960 --> 17:19.710
<b>Super... producer?!</b>

17:20.500 --> 17:24.170
<b><i>Damn it. Don't add corny adjectives to it!</i>
<i>That sounds so shady!</i></b>

17:24.250 --> 17:27.580
<b>Wh-What does someone like him
even know about theater?</b>

17:27.670 --> 17:32.250
<b>Someone so obviously ordinary,
with no unique qualities whatsoever?!</b>

17:32.830 --> 17:35.380
<b><i>You've got quite the personality yourself.</i></b>

17:35.460 --> 17:37.460
<b>Just calm down and listen, Midori.</b>

17:37.540 --> 17:41.880
<b>Yes, at first glance, he is a completely
ordinary boy who may seem unreliable,</b>

17:41.960 --> 17:46.330
<b>not to mention a brutal,
heartless sadist with zero magnanimity...</b>

17:46.420 --> 17:49.080
<b><i>She's enjoying taking</i>
<i>this opportunity to insult me.</i></b>

17:49.670 --> 17:52.130
<b>But his talent as a producer is undeniable.</b>

17:52.210 --> 17:56.670
<b>I'm sure he'll take your
performance to the next level.</b>

17:56.750 --> 18:01.630
<b>If you say so, Onee—I mean, Kageishi-sensei,
then I suppose I can trust you...</b>

18:01.710 --> 18:05.040
<b>but does he have any
accomplishments as a producer?</b>

18:05.670 --> 18:07.130
<b>That's a good question.</b>

18:08.920 --> 18:11.170
<b><i>Hey! How are you gonna get us through this?!</i></b>

18:11.250 --> 18:13.250
<b>- He...
- He?</b>

18:13.670 --> 18:19.380
<b>He... He's produced
tons of hit Hollywood movies!</b>

18:19.460 --> 18:20.960
<b>What?!</b>

18:21.380 --> 18:24.460
<b>Hollywood?! <i>That</i> Hollywood?!</b>

18:25.080 --> 18:28.460
<b>Ohboshi-kun, are you actually... a genius?!</b>

18:28.540 --> 18:30.460
<b><i>Thank goodness she's gullible.</i></b>

18:31.170 --> 18:34.790
<b>Oh, well, I wouldn't call myself
anything that impressive,</b>

18:34.880 --> 18:38.380
<b>but I can at least point out some ways
you can improve... I think.</b>

18:38.460 --> 18:41.670
<b>I don't really get it,
but I guess he's pretty amazing!</b>

18:41.750 --> 18:43.960
<b>Kageishi-sensei brought him to us, after all.</b>

18:44.080 --> 18:46.580
<b>He must be an actual talented producer!</b>

18:46.670 --> 18:51.250
<b>Now that I think about it, his average looks
only make him more authentic!</b>

18:51.330 --> 18:55.210
<b>If he was a talented producer <i>and</i>
good-looking, he'd really seem fake!</b>

18:55.290 --> 18:56.380
<b>Good point!</b>

18:56.460 --> 18:58.630
<b>This is great, President Midori!</b>

18:58.710 --> 19:02.670
<b>With his guidance, we might even
have a shot at nationals!</b>

19:03.000 --> 19:07.130
<b>Still... asking for help from someone
who ridiculed our play?</b>

19:07.210 --> 19:08.330
<b>Also...</b>

19:08.420 --> 19:12.500
<b>Just what is your relationship with
Onee—I mean, Kageishi-sensei?!</b>

19:12.580 --> 19:13.960
<b>Huh? Our relationship?</b>

19:14.040 --> 19:18.250
<b>It's not a... s-s-sexual relationship, is it?</b>

19:18.330 --> 19:20.710
<b><i>- Oh, come on!</i>
- Hey! Midori!</b>

19:20.790 --> 19:23.420
<b>I mean, you're a Hollywood
producer, aren't you?</b>

19:23.500 --> 19:26.250
<b>I-I-I... I know your type!</b>

19:26.710 --> 19:31.630
<b>People like that do d-dirty things
to get work, right?</b>

19:32.000 --> 19:35.750
<b>If you lay a hand on Sumire-oneechan,
I'll make you regret it!</b>

19:35.830 --> 19:37.420
<b><i>Apologize to all of Hollywood!</i></b>

19:38.290 --> 19:40.170
<b>There's nothing like that going on!</b>

19:40.250 --> 19:43.830
<b>What reason would I have
to lust after this creature?</b>

19:43.920 --> 19:44.880
<b>Plenty of reasons!</b>

19:44.960 --> 19:49.670
<b>Onee-chan is sexy, and she has
big boobs and slender legs!</b>

19:50.000 --> 19:52.040
<b>You called her "Onee-chan."</b>

19:52.670 --> 19:56.580
<b>Whatever. I don't need to entertain
these false accusations.</b>

19:56.670 --> 19:58.250
<b>- I'm leaving.
- What?!</b>

19:58.330 --> 19:59.670
<b>Oh, no! He's leaving?</b>

20:04.630 --> 20:06.580
<b>Hey! Why are you leaving?</b>

20:07.000 --> 20:09.330
<b>Weren't you going to help me?</b>

20:09.420 --> 20:12.130
<b>I said I could point out ways
they could improve,</b>

20:12.210 --> 20:14.750
<b>but I never agreed to be their producer.</b>

20:15.500 --> 20:17.920
<b>Besides, the president doesn't want any help,</b>

20:18.000 --> 20:20.330
<b>so the deal's already off.</b>

20:20.420 --> 20:22.960
<b>Wait! I'll convince her!</b>

20:23.080 --> 20:28.000
<b>They're not at a level where my advice
could even help them, anyway.</b>

20:29.210 --> 20:33.290
<b>Can't you somehow work this out using
your know-how from 05th Floor Alliance?</b>

20:33.380 --> 20:36.670
<b>Like you said, they had the script,
the sets, and the sound, right?</b>

20:36.750 --> 20:39.960
<b>I can't teach them the one thing
they do need: how to act.</b>

20:40.040 --> 20:41.920
<b>I know, but...</b>

20:42.000 --> 20:45.420
<b><i>To be honest, I do have</i>
<i>some knowledge of theater.</i></b>

20:45.500 --> 20:48.210
<b><i>And I could just ask Iroha to coach them.</i></b>

20:48.540 --> 20:54.500
<b><i>But not even Murasaki Shikibu-sensei</i>
<i>knows that Iroha's our voice actress,</i></b>

20:54.580 --> 20:56.130
<b><i>so that option's off the table.</i></b>

20:56.210 --> 20:58.880
<b>Anyway, this discussion never happened.</b>

20:58.960 --> 20:59.920
<b>What?!</b>

21:00.000 --> 21:03.250
<b>05th Floor Alliance has enough
to worry about as it is.</b>

21:03.330 --> 21:06.130
<b>Frankly, I don't have time to waste
on other people's problems.</b>

21:06.210 --> 21:07.710
<b>Oh, come on!</b>

21:07.790 --> 21:12.460
<b>So you don't care if I end up as a tennis
coach and can't be your illustrator anymore?!</b>

21:12.790 --> 21:14.500
<b>Who said you were getting off that easily?!</b>

21:14.580 --> 21:17.080
<b>Just draw while you babysit the team!</b>

21:17.170 --> 21:20.330
<b>All you need to do is draw
for forty-eight hours a day!</b>

21:20.580 --> 21:22.830
<b>That's so abusive!</b>

21:22.920 --> 21:26.830
<b>You're their advisor.
Try coming up with a solution yourself.</b>

21:27.130 --> 21:28.830
<b>- I'm outta here.
- What?!</b>

21:28.920 --> 21:30.670
<b>You can't go!</b>

21:31.170 --> 21:32.500
<b><i>Seriously...</i></b>

21:32.580 --> 21:34.920
<b><i>I don't have time for any of this right now.</i></b>

21:35.330 --> 21:36.960
<b><i>Theater, huh?</i></b>

21:37.750 --> 21:40.130
<b><i>I bet she'd be good at stage acting, too.</i></b>

21:40.210 --> 21:42.880
<b><i>But no matter how talented she is,</i></b>

21:42.960 --> 21:45.670
<b><i>she could never stand in the spotlight.</i></b>

21:46.290 --> 21:49.040
<b><i>And damn, is it ever frustrating.</i></b>

21:51.830 --> 21:55.710
<b>Translation: Becky Cottrill</b>

21:56.080 --> 21:59.170
<b>Subtitle Editing: Geoff Mazzolini
Subtitle Timing: Krzysztof Kunc</b>

21:59.710 --> 22:03.040
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Ramirez
Translation Check: David Saylor</b>

23:21.380 --> 23:24.250
<b>WATCH AGAIN NEXT TIME...</b>

23:24.330 --> 23:26.330
<b>YOU'D BETTER WATCH AGAIN NEXT TIME!</b>
